# Staging area for an offline image build: copy your fastembed cache here before `docker compose build`.
# Windows: %TEMP%\fastembed_cache   Linux/macOS: /tmp/fastembed_cache   (or the FASTEMBED_CACHE_PATH you set)
# The directory itself is tracked so the Dockerfile COPY always has a source; its contents stay out of git.
*
!.gitignore
